28	 * - z: undo the last accepted conversation action (single level, 10 s window;
29	 *   the backend's eligibility decision is authoritative). Cmd/Ctrl+Z is left
30	 *   to native text editing.
31	 * - Ignored with Ctrl/Meta/Alt held, during IME composition, inside text fields, and
